1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,350
AI agents can perform advanced
scientific computations,

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:07,350
but researchers need transparent pricing,

3
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:10,840
explicit consent, and verified payments

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,430
before paid workflows execute.

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:18,520
This is a caffeine crystal from the
Crystallography Open Database.

6
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:22,960
The formula-unit view shows a portion
of the loaded structure;

7
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:27,150
the summary identifies disorder
at other sites.

8
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:31,890
In the unit-cell view, overlapping
disorder components create clash warnings.

9
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:35,070
I ask for up to two enumerated
disorder candidates.

10
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:38,340
The MCP tool presents the method,
candidate count,

11
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:41,040
clash warnings, and the two-dollar
Sandbox price.

12
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:43,110
I can approve or cancel.

13
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,440
I approve the PayPal test order.

14
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:52,900
Back in MatterVis, the server verifies
the capture before the analysis runs.

15
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:56,500
I can open the candidate structures,
review their checks,

16
00:00:56,770 --> 00:00:58,400
and download the result package.

17
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:02,370
Physical stability and the experimentally
dominant configuration

18
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:04,380
require independent validation;

19
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:07,960
these candidates are hypotheses
for human review.
